#. さてと…始めんぞ…
msgctxt "0001 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "You ready for this!?"
msgstr ""

#. 始めるって…何を…？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Ready for what...?"
msgstr ""

#. ゼロヨンか？　タイマンか？
#. テメーは、道具アリでもいーぜ？
msgctxt "0003 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"A drag race! One on one, man! I'll even give you a\n"
"head start!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あのさ…石丸クン…
#. 大和田クンの事がショックなのはわかるけど…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Listen, Taka... I know you're in shock over what\n"
"happened to Mondo, but..."
msgstr ""

#. 大和田か…
msgctxt "0005 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Mondo?"
msgstr ""

#. あいつは…ハードラックとダンスっちまったんだよ…
msgctxt "0006 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "He danced with the devil in the pale moonlight..."
msgstr ""

#. …え？　何？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. 月がよぉ…狂ってんだよ…
msgctxt "0008 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "And the moon got him."
msgstr ""

#. おい、いつまで“そこ”にいるんだァ！？
#. あんまチョーシくれてっとひき肉にしちまうよ！？
msgctxt "0009 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Hey, how long are you just gonna stand there!?\n"
"I'm gonna pound you into cold cuts!"
msgstr ""

#. オメーは“仲間”だけどよぉ。
#. “ダチ”じゃねーんだ…
msgctxt "0010 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "You might be my classmate, but you're not my friend!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>意味不明な言葉を残して、
#. 石丸クンは僕の前から去っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Taka left me there, unsure what was going on...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 石丸クン…大丈夫かな…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is Taka okay...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…いや、大丈夫な訳ないよな。
#. どう考えたって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, definitely not. There's very obviously\n"
"something wrong...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>石丸清多夏の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Taka's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with him.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“スキルポイント”<CLT><CLT 23>が上がりました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Your maximum number of <CLT><CLT 3>Skill Points<CLT><CLT 23> has increased!\n"
"Hey, look at you go!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>石丸クンと別れたボクは、
#. いったん自分の部屋へと戻る事にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After we were done, I decided to head back to my room\n"
"for a while...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
